  "description": "Paguro moves a running pod to another node with CRIU – its memory, open\nfiles, emptyDirs and volumes – while its TCP connections and UDP flows\ncontinue. With this plugin you migrate a pod – to a node you name or\none Paguro picks – and follow it until it is done, drain a node by\nmigrating its pods away, list and describe migrations, see which\nnodes can take part, and show the versions of the plugin and of\nPaguro in the cluster.\n",
